  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reintegration of FARC ex-combatants in community health structures</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project contributes to strengthen the public health system and improve the access to and coverage of health care in historically conflict-affected rural areas of Colombia, within the framework of the 2016 Peace Agreement. The main target groups are local rural communities  and former FARC-EP members. The project also seeks to employ ex-combatants previously trained in health to provide professional services in these areas.</narrative>
  </description>
